{"id":268122,"imdb":"tt0070663","en":"Anno Domini 1573","orig":"Seljačka buna 1573","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"Europe in second half of 16th century was very rough place to live. Peasants of Slovenia and Croatia had even rougher times because of the constant threat of Turk raids and being taxed to death in order to provide defence against the Turks. But, the worst things were arrogant local feudal lords led by Franjo Tahi who were oppresing the common folk. All that led to the great peasant revolt of 1573. The movie is made for the 400th anniversary of the event.","rd":"1975-11-14","rt":145,"g":[18,36,10752],"lang":"hr","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Jadran film","logo":"/AmNSNdDaByDpc0bzekWFeYRXDW2.png","c":"HR"},{"n":"Croatia Film","logo":null,"c":"HR"}],"countries":["YU"],"langs":["Croatian","Hungarian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"YU","d":"1975-11-14"}],"dir":["Vatroslav Mimica"],"prod":["Sulejman Kapić"],"wri":["Vatroslav Mimica","August Šenoa"],"mus":["Alfi Kabiljo"],"dop":[],"cast":[{"n":"Fabijan Šovagović","ch":"Matija Gubec","p":"/4Ahlu8Ru5kpooJbT1BoUPj1ZdG4.jpg"},{"n":"Velimir 'Bata' Živojinović","ch":"Ilija Gregorić","p":"/qOWUgCYeYIcqbpx8ixAajpIRVuy.jpg"},{"n":"Pavle Vuisić","ch":"Franjo Tahy","p":"/eL9qCNhZwlq4IIzCM7Dzulb4jLp.jpg"},{"n":"Sergio Mimica-Gezzan","ch":"Petar","p":"/5JSARSBOHvxkelxw8X6j4sRivoe.jpg"},{"n":"Franjo Majetić","ch":"Gladni glumac","p":null},{"n":"Zdenka Heršak","ch":"Kata Palondra","p":null},{"n":"Boris Festini","ch":"Guska","p":null},{"n":"Marina Nemet","ch":"Regica","p":null},{"n":"Charles Millot","ch":"Juraj Drašković","p":"/4d6c7Eb9FMEGIOzeeY9xnZSZ9Kk.jpg"},{"n":"Lojze Rozman","ch":"Gašpar Alapić","p":"/f9jHaqYMaPoM1MEIMojR341M5tr.jpg"},{"n":"Zvonimir Črnko","ch":"Van Hovig","p":"/nCX84iNE4piYhyp3gUvJ5NvgUlj.jpg"},{"n":"Đuro Utješanović","ch":"Gabro Tahy","p":null},{"n":"Mate Ergović","ch":"Dvorski","p":null},{"n":"Zdenka Trach","ch":"Seljanka","p":null},{"n":"Petar Dobrić","ch":"Martin","p":null},{"n":"Ivica Kunej","ch